进行改良后的细刀。融合中日技法，招式以劈砍为主。其刀身狭长，攻守兼备，兼具日本刀的速度与中华武术的沉稳。","en":"A slender saber modified by Yamatai craftsmen. Blending Chinese and Japanese techniques, its forms focus primarily on slashing. Its long, narrow blade serves well in both offense and defense, combining the speed of a Japanese blade with the composure of Chinese martial arts."},"atkVal":"12","price":"13000","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1001402","name":{"zh":"倭甲","en":"Wa Armor"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"独特的盔甲，或许来自异族。","en":"A unique suit of armor, perhaps of foreign origin."},"defenceVal":"12","mp":"280","evade":"4","price":"11000","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1029605","name":{"zh":"倭刀","en":"Eastern Saber"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"由邪马台工匠进行改良后的细刀。融合中日技法，招式以劈砍为主。其刀身狭长，攻守兼备，兼具日本刀的速度与中华武术的沉稳。","en":"A slender saber modified by Yamatai craftsmen. Blending Chinese and Japanese techniques, its forms focus primarily on slashing. Its long, narrow blade serves well in both offense and defense, combining the speed of a Japanese blade with the composure of Chinese martial arts."},"atkVal":"12","price":"13000","slot":{"zh":"盾","en":"Shield"}}],"family":{"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ20135","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI110615","name":{"zh":"卑弥呼氏","en":"The Himiko clan"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自倭人，邪马台国女王，能使鬼道（方术），以妖惑众，年长不嫁。邪马台国女王卑弥呼，汉桓、灵年间倭国大乱，卑弥呼以鬼道平定内乱登上王位。景初二年，卑弥呼遣使难升米至魏，魏明帝封其为“亲魏倭王”，授金印。在位五十余年，七十多岁去世。是《三国志》记载中与中国正式建交的日本古代君主。","en":"Originating from the Wa people, Queen of Yamatai, she was skilled in occult arts (sorcery), beguiled the multitude with supernatural ways, and remained unmarried into mature years. Queen Himiko of Yamatai: during the reigns of Emperors Huan and Ling of Han, the land of Wa fell into great turmoil, Himiko quelled the strife through occult arts and ascended the throne. In the second year of Jingchu, Himiko dispatched the envoy Nashime to Wei, and Emperor Ming of Wei conferred upon her the title ‘Queen of Wa, Friend of Wei,’ presenting her with a gold seal. She reigned for more than fifty years and died in her seventies. She is an ancient Japanese Ruler recorded in the Records of the Three Kingdoms who established formal diplomatic relations with China."},"talent":{"military":"6","commerce":"7","politics":"5"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[[["WJ20134","奴家"],["WJ20134","奴家"],["WJ20134","This humble woman"],["WJ20134","私め"],["WJ20134","소녀"]]],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"35","startPregnantAge":"35"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ11050","city":"CS1066","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[78,85,55,11,80,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1029605","armor":"WP1001402","shield":"WP1029605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1066","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[78,85,55,11,80,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1029605","armor":"WP1001402","shield":"WP1029605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":"WJ11050","city":"CS1066","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[78,85,55,11,80,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1029605","armor":"WP1001402","shield":"WP1029605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10402","name":{"zh":"诸侯讨董","en":"Coalition Against Dong Zhuo"},"year":"190","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ11050","city":"CS1066","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,85,55,11,80,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{